very morning from 8 am till 9 am\"}, {\"text\": \"She visited the rosegarden right after her breakfast.\", \"line\": 7, \"span\": \"right after her breakfast\"}, {\"text\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up\"}, {\"text\": \"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden.\", \"line\": 8, \"span\": \"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden\"}, {\"text\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter.\", \"line\": 12, \"span\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter\"}, {\"text\": \"Once spring arrived, the rosegarden turned back to life and color.\", \"line\": 13, \"span\": \"But once spring arrived, it turned back to life and color\"}, {\"text\": \"The rose garden was the private property of the royal family.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"While the rose garden was the private property of the royal family\"}, {\"text\": \"The princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"the young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st\"}, {\"text\": \"During that time, people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"During that time, people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden just like their beloved princess\"}, {\"text\": \"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most\"}, {\"text\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home.\", \"line\": 22, \"span\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home\"}, {\"text\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home.\", \"line\": 23, \"span\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home\"}, {\"text\": \"In many cases, it was a tie because the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage.\", \"line\": 24, \"span\": \"In many cases, it was a tie because the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\"}]}","ttft_ms":7276,"type":"result","duration_ms":7391,"uuid":"23506236-8777-4524-a441-aef3cab5d5ae","ttft_stream_ms":1344,"time_to_request_ms":60,"first_content_frame_ms":1345,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
